    "The complete original BaseCaseLFunctionData mixes two arbitrary data types, a label, two supplied real coordinates, an actual equality to the original symbolic Core.spectralPivot, an arbitrary centralValueNonzero proposition with proof, two further proposition-valued fields and a Bool. Neither coordinate is defined as the center of an actual L-function.",
