    "The source documentation mentions raw center1 and normalized1/2, but no translation function, analytic hypotheses, numerical substitution or independent witness is provided. Preserve that documentation as source context, not a proved claim.",
    "Archive all three exact commands. Splitting the own-provider record or extracting its actual equality theorem would retain the mixed contract as a maintained interface or invent a new historical self-provider import. Do neither; no hypotheses or fields are discarded."
